@startuml Get_Movie_Recommendations
title Get Movie Recommendations (US01 / US03 / US10)

actor User
participant "SmartCine App" as App
participant "Recommendation Service" as RecSvc
database "Movie & Ratings DB" as DB

User -> App: Request recommendations
App -> RecSvc: getRecommendations(userId)
RecSvc -> DB: fetch user's rating count
DB --> RecSvc: ratingCount

alt ratingCount >= 5 (BR5 - personalized path, US03)
    RecSvc -> DB: fetch user's ratings & genre preferences
    DB --> RecSvc: preference data
    RecSvc -> RecSvc: run collaborative filtering
    RecSvc -> DB: fetch candidate movies (rating >= 6.0, BR4)
    DB --> RecSvc: candidate movies
    RecSvc -> RecSvc: exclude already-watched movies (BR1)
    RecSvc -> RecSvc: remove duplicate movies (BR7)
    RecSvc -> RecSvc: apply tie-break ordering (BR9)
    RecSvc -> RecSvc: limit to top 10 (BR3)
else ratingCount < 5 (BR6 - cold start path, US10)
    RecSvc -> DB: fetch trending / critically acclaimed movies (rating count >= 100, BR8)
    DB --> RecSvc: trending movies
    RecSvc -> RecSvc: limit to top 10 (BR3)
end

RecSvc --> App: recommendation list (<= 10 movies)
App --> User: display recommendations (US01)

@enduml
